	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nunciavit mihi affinis meus (reverende in <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Christo pater) tuis verbis res in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> recte s<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>e habere; scripsit idem d. legatus, d. <persName ref="p8160">de Bellieure</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Id mihi periucundum fuit audire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Heri <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tandem nactus sum integra concilii <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><placeName ref="l1107">Tride<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ntini</placeName>; etsi autem invitus dimitto, tamen tibi mitto; <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>si habes iam ante, aliquando remitte; sin minus <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>retine, cura tamen, ut <persName ref="p1227">Froscoverus</persName> aliquot exemplaria <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l157">Francoforto</placeName> advehat, ut inde reparare possim.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Exierunt praeterea <placeName ref="l522">Venetiis</placeName> disputationes adversarii <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mei <placeName ref="l875">Hispani</placeName>, cuius hic titulum mitto, sed liber <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>integer ad me non venit, quod pessime <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>me habet; desiderantur enim quaedam folia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Est additus libellus de traditionibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Itaque monendus erat <persName ref="p1227">F<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>roscoverus</persName>, ut haec quoque exemplaria pro amicis afferat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">An rediturus sit <persName>Phil<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ippi</persName> legatus, prout constanter ferebatur, dubito; nihil hic certi affirmare pos<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName>Cardinalis Madrucius</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Cristoforo oder Ludovico Madruzzo.</note> <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName> cum mala pontificis gratia discessisse fertur; s<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ic <persName ref="p8114">Balingketus</persName> <placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName> audivit, tamen causa offensae in tam parva mora resciri nondum potuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Hannibalis miles versatur in agro <placeName>Cremonensi</placeName>; conscribitur quoque in agro <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanensi</placeName> miles.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sic <persName ref="p8114">B<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>alingketus</persName> affirmat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Das ein fändli lyt noch zuͦ <persName>Rovere</persName> 2 myl under <placeName ref="l1107">Drient</placeName>, daa ettliche der obersten <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>gefangen.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Zuͦ <placeName>Hall</placeName> im <placeName>Ynthal</placeName> stirbt es redlich.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Das waßer hett hin und wider in <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> großen schaden gethon.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Novi praeterea nihil habemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Italia nobi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>s clausa est propter pestem; itaque <persName ref="p8114">Balingketus</persName> affirmat caseos illos, quos petit d. d. <persName ref="p8075">Erastus</persName>, nunc com<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>parari non posse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Si tu prior ad d. d. <persName ref="p8075">Erastum</persName> scribis, eum de hoc toto edoce.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverend<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>e in Christo pater, cum tuis omnibus quam felicissime et diutissime.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Si scribis, adde more s<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>olito collegae salutem, ne per me suspicetur sua elata esse; sinam, ut ipse se prodat suo tempore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>24. iulii anno 1564.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">F litera redundabat et in caeteris desider<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>abantur quaedam; itaque mitto tibi hoc folium, ut habeas gustum et videas qua litera excusa; noli remittere; <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>non opus habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, domino suo et in Christo patri reverendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zur<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Zürich StA, E II 375, 745; Hiezu ein Blatt:]</note>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Disputat<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>iones adversus protestationem triginta quatuor haereticorum <placeName ref="l18">Augustanae</placeName> c<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>onfessionis habita a <persName>Gasparo Cardillo</persName>, Villalpandaeo, <placeName ref="l875">Hispano</placeName> Segobiensi, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>doctore theologo, pro sacra oecumenica synodo <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentina</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Simul etiam redditur ratio multorum, quae in eadem sacra synodo contigerunt.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Ad il<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>lustrissimum reverendum dominum <persName>Carolum Borromaeum</persName>, S.R.E. presbyterum cardinalem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Cum privilegio <placeName ref="l522">Venetiis</placeName> apud Donatum Berte<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>llum 1564.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Sunt disputationes 9, quarum titulos, si vis, alias mittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Haeretici, qui partim exprofesso, partim obiter a nobis confutan<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>tur in his disputationibus: Triginta quatuor protestantes, superintendentes <placeName ref="l210">Heydelbergae</placeName>, <persName ref="p1974">Luther</persName>, <persName ref="p2095">Melanchton</persName>, <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>Montanus</persName>, <persName ref="p3375">Vergerius</persName>, <persName>Wiclefus</persName>, <persName ref="p5327">Ussus</persName>, Pragensis, <persName>Nicolaus Gallus</persName>, <persName ref="p2336">Ochinus</persName>, <persName ref="p8111">Petrus Martyr</persName>, <persName ref="p3018">Stancar</persName>, <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglius</persName>, <persName>Svenchfeldius</persName>, <persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>, <persName>Pomeranus</persName>, <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName>, <persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName>, <persName>Sleydanus</persName>, <persName>Dorpius</persName>, <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName>, <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName>, <persName>Monhemus</persName>, Confessio <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p6210">Urbanus Rhegius</persName> Prefatur in hunc libro primo ipse au<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>thor, deinde <persName>Iacobus Gibertus</persName>, episcopus <placeName>Aliphanus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Hic authorem miris laudibu<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>s effert, ut praecipuum Lutheromastyga.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Appellat me religionis <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>pontificiae desertorem et tra<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>nsfugam, quasi vero unquam illarum partium fuerim, qui transfugerim.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
